## Checklist for ANY assertion / safety-guard / prompt change

1. If it is a post-processing layer change, update the shared module in `libs/pipeline/post_processing.py` (both paths inherit automatically)
2. Update the runtime extraction prompt (`libs/prompts/extraction_v1.py`)
3. Update the escalation prompts (`libs/llm_client/escalation.py`)
4. Update the ask-leo-rank inline prompt (`_training_askleo.py`)
5. Update ALL `_VALID_ASSERTIONS` sets. Verified 2026-08-28, there are six:
   `services/api/app/routers/coding_review.py`,
   `services/api/app/routers/training_synthetic_data.py`,
   `services/coding_worker/app/pipeline/llm_extractor.py`,
   `libs/pipeline_graph/subgraphs/_extractor.py` (named
   `_VALID_ASSERTIONS_EXTRACT`), `libs/model_registry/training_adapter.py`,
   and `libs/prompts/test_patient_scenario_v1.py`
6. Update both `_AUTO_CODE_BLOCKED` sets:
   `libs/coding_engine/tier_classifier.py` and
   `services/api/app/services/label_verifier.py`
7. Update `_ASSERTION_QUEUE_SET` in `services/api/app/services/label_verifier.py`
   if the assertion needs human review
8. Update `_assertion_context()` in `documents_queries.py`
9. Update `_NON_PRESENT` if the assertion should block patient-level shortcuts
10. Update assertion review queue Cypher filters if needed
11. Update UI: `ASSERTION_OPTIONS`, `ASSERTION_CHIP`, `AssertionChip.tsx`
12. Update ConText engine if the assertion can be detected from text patterns
13. Add tests covering both paths (parity tests in `tests/test_pipeline_parity.py`)
